  (text "U2 on-board thumbstick (Alps RKJXV1224005 / PS2 3D-rocker clone, e.g. desoldered from a KY-023 module).\nJ8 X_SRC / J9 Y_SRC: jumper 1-2 = on-board stick, 2-3 = external J3 header (hall sensor, pot, ...).\nThe selected X/Y then goes through X_SEL / Y_SEL to A0..A3.\nPush switch wired diagonally (a <-> d): works whichever way the clone pairs its 4 legs.\nNOTE: 74HC165 SER (pin 10) is on CHAIN_IN with R1 10k pull-up, not tied directly to 3V3."
    (at 38.1 276.86 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "3e2aa137-78f9-4c00-a75b-2339370ae480")
  )
